{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018LtV6aJStL5oXvaNiJm8oq","type":"tool_result","content":"302:*Deliberately not covered here:* what you'd run to find out **why**. `kubectl describe`, the event stream, and the scheduler's own message are Chapter 13's material, and the fact that you know exactly what state to look for is what will make that chapter fast.\n333:kubectl get nodes --show-labels\n334:kubectl label nodes <your-node-name> disktype=ssd\n424:Taints go on and come off with `kubectl taint`. The removal form is the same command with a trailing minus sign, which is easy to miss and easy to mistype:\n427:kubectl taint nodes node1 key1=value1:NoSchedule\n428:kubectl taint nodes node1 key1=value1:NoSchedule-\n532:> A platform team buys eight GPU nodes. They're expensive, they're scarce, and the machine-learning group has waited four months for them. The obvious first move is to keep everyone else off, so the team taints all eight: `kubectl taint nodes gpu-01 dedicated=ml:NoSchedule`, and so on down the list.\n1105:[Omitted long matching line]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c977363c-b218-4f47-91fb-e430a06317c3","uuid":"dc311f89-58f9-4c28-9a65-492b0d581d4b","timestamp":"2026-08-24T14:10:35.850Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"302:*Deliberately not covered here:* what you'd run to find out **why**. `kubectl describe`, the event stream, and the scheduler's own message are Chapter 13's material, and the fact that you know exactly what state to look for is what will make that chapter fast.\n333:kubectl get nodes --show-labels\n334:kubectl label nodes <your-node-name> disktype=ssd\n424:Taints go on and come off with `kubectl taint`. The removal form is the same command with a trailing minus sign, which is easy to miss and easy to mistype:\n427:kubectl taint nodes node1 key1=value1:NoSchedule\n428:kubectl taint nodes node1 key1=value1:NoSchedule-\n532:> A platform team buys eight GPU nodes. They're expensive, they're scarce, and the machine-learning group has waited four months for them. The obvious first move is to keep everyone else off, so the team taints all eight: `kubectl taint nodes gpu-01 dedicated=ml:NoSchedule`, and so on down the list.\n1105:[Omitted long matching line]","numLines":8,"totalLines":8}}
